"ecology" and "status" characters added to the end based primarily on 
- Samuels & VanValkenburgh 2008 JOURNAL OF MORPHOLOGY 269:1387–1411 (2008)
- Hedrick et al. 2020. The evolutionary diversity of locomotor innovation in rodents is not linked to proximal limb morphology. Scientific Reports. 2020 Jan 20;10(1):717.
and other internet sources
]

